  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Ipomoea pes-tigridis",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipomoea_pes-tigridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1311842183,
      "text": "Ipomoea pes-tigridis is a species of Ipomoea in the family Convolvulaceae. It is known as tiger foot ipomoea or tiger foot morning glory. The species is native to tropical and subtropical regions of Asia, Africa, and New Guinea, and is naturalised in Australia. It grows from sea level up to 400 m. It is the type species of the genus Ipomoea."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Ipomoea pes-tigridis",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipomoea_pes-tigridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 208010651,
      "text": "Ipomoea pes-tigridis est une espèce de plantes dicoylédones de la famille des Convolvulaceae, tribu des Ipomoeeae, originaire des régions tropicales de l'Ancien Monde. C'est une plante herbacée annuelle aux tiges grêles pouvant atteindre 3 mètres de long, aux feuilles palmatilobées caractéristiques, finement pileuses ou strigueuses, et aux fleurs infundibuliformes blanches, roses ou pourpres."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Ipomoea pes-tigridis",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipomoea_pes-tigridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29677467,
      "text": "Ipomoea pes-tigridis adalah spesies dari genus Ipomoea dan keluarga Convolvulaceae. Spesies ini tersebar di Asia, Afrika, Australia, dan pulau-pulau di Pasifik. Tanaman ini hidup di pinggir jalan dan pantai dengan ketinggian antara 0 hingga 400 m."
    }
  },
